  "description": "Ordinary college student Ji Eun-Jun has had a crush on someone for 10 years. It's none other than her father's former co-worker and close friend, Won Seong-Chan. And at a tarot cafe he visits to get advice on confessing his love... he gets a 'fool card' that tells him not to be afraid of any adventure.\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Lezhin's Hachankong Danpyeonseon (하찮공 단편선) Collection.*",
